### ============================================================
### COST ANOMALY DETECTION — API Test File
### Uses VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### Install: Ctrl+Shift+X → search "REST Client"
### Run: Click "Send Request" above any request block
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey  = dev-api-key
@date    = 2025-03-13

### ── Health Check (no auth needed) ────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ── Task 1: Fetch Billing from GCP BigQuery ──────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/fetch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── Task 2: Aggregate Costs by Team/Project ──────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── View Raw Costs for a Date ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/raw?date={{date}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ── Task 3: Detect Anomalies ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/anomaly/detect
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── List Anomalies for a Date ──────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anomaly/list?date={{date}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ── Task 4: Compare Against Budgets ───────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/compare
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── List All Team Budgets ──────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/list
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ── Upsert a Budget ────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/upsert
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "teamId": "platform",
  "projectId": "proj-platform-prod",
  "monthlyBudget": 50000,
  "alertThreshold": 0.80,
  "ownerEmail": "platform-lead@yourcompany.com"
}

### ── Task 5: Send Alerts (Slack + Email) ───────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/send
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── Task 6: Create ServiceNow Tickets ─────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/create
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── Auth Test: Missing API Key (expect 401) ───────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/fetch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}

### ── Auth Test: Wrong API Key (expect 403) ─────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/fetch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: wrong-key

{
  "date": "{{date}}"
}
